            "notes": "now ur zoomin \ud83d\ude0e \n\nyou may not be doing crazy damage here, but what you are doing is driving everyone insane. their Cassidy, Reaper, DVA, etc. will be punching their keyboard unable to catch you with their support in their ear crying, \"why isn't anyone taking care of the Winton!?\"\n\nNow, the build isn't super powerful YET. But if played right, you can really make the enemy team waste a ton of resources trying to take you out. And if you play this build right, then this is the round you'll start draining the enemy teams mental. making it even easier to beat them later on. \n\nit's a VERY annoying build to play against. it doesn't insta-kill anyone, but when you got a Winston dropping on you every 5 seconds making you and your teammates expend your resources to survive and try to kill him, it makes it impossible. to get to play the game.",
