            "created_at": "2025-09-22T13:09:47.840929+00:00",
            "notes": "Now, the only thing that matters is getting that 50% cooldown reduction and making sure you have Hardlight Accelorator. Why, you ask? Because if you time your jumps right, you will ALWAYS have that 3x 5% weapon power. Meaning not only are you jumping every couple seconds thanks to the other cooldown reduction items, you also have a 25% weapon power item for 3k less than Eye of the Spider. Which goes cray cray as you're ALSO applying Cybervenom almost INSTANTLY after it's 2 seconds ends. Meaning you got 25% weapon power going while the enemy has a near constant 30% healing debuff. AAAAAAAAAND you're pretty much CONSTANTLY healing with Moon Landing as well! You're never not healing. \n\nIridescent Iris and Unstable Prototype unfortunately are literally only here just to get you to 50% cooldown reduction. Unfortunately other than ability power and maybe a tiny lil dmg when ur shield explodes, they don't really do much else for you. But everything I've mentioned above is plenty enough to justify their existences.",
