            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-22T13:09:47.840929+00:00",
            "notes": "Electro Cluster combined with Hardlight Accelorator (long as you still have all the items getting you to 50% cooldown reduction) means you could theoretically have 40% weapon power for only the cost of 11k and one power. While also still causing a ton of jump dmg, an essentially never ending healing debuff, and healing at an exponential rate. You're pretty much a 1 monkey army at this point. I can't tell you how many backlines I've devasted with this late game build. The Anas I've made cry. It's unstoppable at this point and I've never lost a game by round 6.\n\nAlso yeah because of the 50% cooldown reduction, you can get rid of every movement power except for Zero-G, as you'll be spending your time jumpin instead of runnin from now on. But keep Zero-G. If you don't, those couple seconds you're not jumping will feel like eternity at this point. Trust me. Do not turn off Zero-G by this round you will not enjoy it.",
